      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxidation-resistance improvement is associated with formation of a dense oxidation film on the alloy surface.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo-Nb-Ta-W can serve as the initial RHEA system.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::chunk::001::introduction::f13797f6f6"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHEA compositions may also contain elements such as Ti, Cr, V, Si, and Al.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::chunk::001::introduction::f13797f6f6",
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is alloying the RHEA with Cr, Al, and Si.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention is intended for a high-temperature environment.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant high-temperature environment may be above 800 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr, Al, and Si react with oxygen to form a protective oxide scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective oxide scale reduces the alloy's oxidation rate.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified RHEA will have improved high-temperature oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Improved oxidation resistance may increase service life and reliability in high-temperature applications.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHEAs without the added Cr, Al, and Si have poor oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::chunk::001::introduction::f13797f6f6"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A proper or optimal amount of Cr, Al, and Si is needed to obtain oxidation-resistance improvement.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr, Al, and Si additions may compromise mechanical properties by promoting brittle intermetallic compounds.",
